The code statements that fix the bug are:
```c
#include "../globals.h"
#include "module_private.h"
#include "../module_shared.h"
```
Reason:
Reordering the header file inclusions to place `module_private.h` before `module_shared.h` ensures that all necessary dependencies are resolved correctly, allowing the Mac build process to succeed without errors.

